abstract: >-
  Python code for detecting slip-stick force peaks in release-liner peel data
  from a modified FINAT FTM 10-type 180 degree integration test. The package
  applies instrumental-noise characterization, zero-phase Butterworth filtering,
  and Savitzky-Golay baseline correction to identify positive residual-force
  excursions above the configured threshold.
keywords:
  - slip-stick
  - release liner
  - signal processing
  - materials science
  - friction
  - adhesion
  - modified FINAT FTM 10
  - Python
